{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21683","headline":"和乐天赠杨秘书 · 元稹","name":"和乐天赠杨秘书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧与杨郎在帝城，搜天斡地觅诗情。\n曾因竝句甘称小，不爲论年便唤兄。\n刮骨直穿由苦鬬，梦肠翻出暂闲行。\n因君投赠还相和，老去那能竞底名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}